# Tom, Bert, and William: "{1}, Sacrifice another creature: Draw cards equal to the sacrificed creature's power, then discard a card."
# On turn 3 Bot1 gives one of its two Ornithopters (0/2) +3/+3 with Giant Growth, activates the ability sacrificing it, and holding
# priority activates it again sacrificing the other, a 0/2. The second activation resolves first: its own sacrificed creature had
# power 0, so Bot1 draws nothing and has nothing to discard. The first then draws three, the power of the creature its own cost
# sacrificed, though another activation was made after it (CR 602.2b, 608.2h), and Bot1 discards one.

